== Trivia ==
* ??? appeared in the original ''Binding of Isaac'', with the same unlock method.
* The name "Blue Baby" was used in the original ''Binding of Isaac'', where it would appear in Isaac's Last Will in parentheses after dying as him. This was removed in ''Rebirth''.
** ??? is referred to as "Blue Baby" in the game files and in ''The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls''. It is also used for the name of a co-op baby that resembles him.
** The name is a reference to [[wikipedia:blue baby syndrome|blue baby syndrome]], in which a baby's skin complexion appears blue from a lack of oxygen in its blood due to a congenital heart defect.
* ???'s design originally came from [https://www.newgrounds.com/portal/view/12725 Dead Baby Dressup!], one of Edmund McMillen's first Flash games.
** Many of Edmund's older flash games on Newgrounds feature ??? and {{i|Brother Bobby}}. ??? was Edmund's mascot from 1996 to 2002.
** Edmund's username on Newgrounds is 'Bluebaby'.
* In several cutscenes, Isaac is shown suffocating inside a chest. ??? is first seen inside an identical chest, and {{E|???}} is the follow-up boss after {{E|Isaac}}. Blue skin tone is typically used to show suffocation, and cross-shaped eyes imply that the character is deceased.
** After death, the bowels of the deceased will sometimes loosen, causing them to defecate. This is most likely the reason ??? starts with {{i|The Poop}}.
*** For this reason, ??? might represent a sort of loss of human dignity for Isaac, seeing as how he died in such a horrific and embarrassing manner. This is possibly reflected in ending 10 of the game, where ??? smiles at Isaac, terrifying him, possibly reminding him of how he died.
* ??? does not appear in the Bible or any religious scripture. He is the first character with this distinction, and the only one to appear in the original ''Binding of Isaac'' — the second being {{C|The Lost}} in ''Rebirth'', third being {{C|Keeper}} in ''Afterbirth'', and fourth being {{C|The Forgotten}} in ''Afterbirth+''.
* Like all characters that start with only soul/black hearts, ???'s starting health is listed as "-I" on the character selection screen.
* As a secret character, ??? does not appear on the character select screen until unlocked.
** He shares this trait with {{C|The Lost}}, {{C|Keeper}}, and {{C|The Forgotten}}.

